msgid ""
"<strong>Simple Social Buttons</strong> by <strong><a "
"href=\"https://wpbrigade.com/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_"
"medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade</a></strong> adds "
"an advanced set of social media sharing buttons to your WordPress sites, "
"such as: <strong>Facebook</strong>, <strong>Twitter/X</strong>, "
"<strong>LinkedIn</strong>, <strong>WhatsApp</strong>, "
"<strong>Viber</strong>, <strong>Reddit</strong> and "
"<strong>Pinterest</strong>. This makes it the most flexible social sharing "
"plugin for everyone."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Enkla sociala knappar</strong> från <strong><a "
"href=\"https://wpbrigade.com/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_"
"medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade</a></strong> lägger "
"till ett avancerat set av knappar för delning på sociala medier till dina "
"WordPress-sajter, såsom: <strong>Facebook</strong>, "
"<strong>Twitter/X</strong>, <strong>LinkedIn</strong>, "
"<strong>WhatsApp</strong>, <strong>Viber</strong>, <strong>Reddit</strong> "
"och <strong>Pinterest</strong>. Detta gör det till det mest flexibla "
"pluginet för delning på sociala medier för alla."

